        <Entry Name="malo_giveup_01">Hide and seek, hide and seek.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="malo_giveup_02">Come out, ye'll like what I have planned.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="victor_idle_01">Help me, please, help me.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="victor_idle_02">Can ye hear me? It be not too late to set things right.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="victor_idle_03">Anyone there?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="victor_idle_04">How did ye escape?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="victor_idle_05">Have ye seen Justine?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="victor_discover_01">Whoever ye be, if ye could help me, I would be much obliged.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="victor_terrorized_01">Please! Please, be reasonable. Yarr, ye don't have to do this.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="victor_dying_01">Argh! Why? I was just tryin' to help.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="hector_idle_01">Ye'll burn fer this - ye'll burn fer this!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="hector_idle_02">Sick, twisted child.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="hector_idle_03">... the kingdoms o' this world be become the kingdoms o' our Lord, and o' his Christ...</Entry>
        <Entry Name="hector_idle_04">... king o' kings, lord o' lords...</Entry>
        <Entry Name="hector_idle_05">... and he shall reign omnipotent fer ever and ever.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="hector_discover_01">Who be ye?! Who be there?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="hector_terrorized_01">... argh! Have mercy...</Entry>
        <Entry Name="hector_terrorized_02">... argh, help me God...</Entry>
        <Entry Name="hector_dying_01">...argh...the trumpet... shall sound... argh.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="felix_idle_01">Hey, can anyone hear me?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="felix_idle_02">What be goin' on out there? I be Detective Marot o' the Sûreté Nationale and I demand to know what be goin' on!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="felix_idle_03">Yarr, there be no escape, me men will be here any minute now!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="felix_idle_04">Yarr, ye won't get away with this.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="felix_idle_05">Who be that? What do ye want from me?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="felix_discover_01">Avast, ye there, Help me, and I'll call on me men to save us from this hellhole.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="felix_terrorized_01">Do ye think this be funny, ye think this be funny, don't ye?!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="felix_dying_01">What be ye doin', no God!... argh</Entry>
        <Entry Name="justine_end_01">Finally... I feel like meself again - That was quite the journey.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="justine_end_look_01">That be me... ain't it? All covered in chains.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="justine_end_look_02">Such intricate machinery. I can't fer the life o' me understand why he built this..... yarr.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="justine_end_look_03">They can't hurt me anymore.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="justine_end_look_04">Such light was never meant fer me.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="justine_end_02">This... this was the best one yet.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="justine_end_03">So elaborate - it's just... too much.</Entry>
