        <Entry Name="victor_saved_02">Open the door and let us remove ourselves from this dungeon.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="hector_saved_02">God be praised. Ye have saved us child... yarr. Open the door.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="victor_saved_03">Justine, I know it be ye. I promise I will get ye help if ye just open the door.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="justine_end_door_01">It's already locked, but ye can never be too certain.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="justine_end_door_02">It be all right, no one will be comin' through that door. It be locked and bolted.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="clarice_end_01">Mademoiselle Justine, be ye down there. Be everythin' all right?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="justine_end_05">o' course, Clarice, I be quite all right.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="justine_end_06">Be everythin' ready fer tonight?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="clarice_end_02">Aye. The goose be ready any minute now, the guests should be arrivin' within the hour.</Entry>
